<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- 1 TIMOTI - Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lutaanzi LwaPawulu kuliTimoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Lutaanzi LwaPawulu Kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lugwalo lwaTimoti lutaanzi</char> ndugwalo mutumwa Pawulu ndwakalembela sikwiiya wakwe Timoti. Timoti mutaanzi wakalembwa mumunyaka wamakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi aminyaka iibili kuyoosika kumakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi lilaaminyaka iine kaali Kkirisitu wazyalwa. Ooku ngakulaba afwiifwi akumamanino abuumi bwaPawulu. Pawulu wakali abulidilano buli afwiifwi loko aTimoti mane wakali kumwaamba kuti mwana wakwe chiindi chiingi (Filipu 2:22; 1 Timoti 1:2,18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Oolu nduulumwi lwamagwalo aane azwa kuli Pawulu akali langene amuntu peepe kumbungano. Amwi magwalo aatatu nguTimoti wachibili aTayitasi aFilimoni. Timoti mutaanzi uli amalayilile mayingi atala abukombi bwamumbungano. (1 Timoti 2:1-15), Zyeelelo zyabuzulidi bwamumbungano (1 Timoti 3:1-13), Machenjezyo atala abayiisyi babeji. (1 Timoti 1:3-11, 4:1-5, 6:2-5) Eechi chitondeezya Pawulu mbwakayiisya Timoti kuti abe muzulidi akati kambungano. Timoti mutaanzi upa malayilile mayingi anga alagwasya bazulidi mumazuba asunu kuti bakonzye kweendelezya mulimu wambungano mubusena mubabede.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu utalika kujuzya Timoti (1 Timoti 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo upa machenjezyo kuli Timoti atala abayiisyi babeji (1 Timoti 1:3-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu wiinkilila anembo akupandulula ambwalumba ankaambo kaJesu Kkirisitu (1 Timoti 1:12-19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela ulayilila Timoti atala abukombi mpawo abazulidi bambungano (1 Timoti 2:1—3:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu umanisya lugwalo lwakwe akupa Timoti malayilile akumamanisizyo (1 Timoti 4:1—6:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Ndime Pawulu, mutumwa waKkirisitu Jesu, akulayilila kwaLeza Mufutuli wesu akwa Kkirisitu Jesu ooyo bulangilizi bwesu, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Kuli Timoti, mwana wangu wachoonzyo mulusyomo: Luzyalo, luse, aluumuno kuzwa kuli Leza Taata aKkirisitu Jesu Mwami wesu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machenjezyo Atala Anjiisyo Yakubeja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Mbuli mbundakakulayilila nindakali kuya kuMasedoniya, chaala kuEfeso kuti ukalalile bamwi bantu kuti batayiisyi injiisyo isiyene, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />nikuba kulipeda ansyomo amazyalane atajinki apa kukangana kwiinda kusungwazya mabambe aLeza aayo alimulusyomo. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Impalamo yamalayilile eesu nduyando oolo luzwa kumoyo ululeme amuzeezo mubotu alusyomo lululeme. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bamwi bantu bakaleya kuli zeezi bakasweekela mukwaambuula majwi abiyo, <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />kabayandisya kuba bayiisi bamulawu, pesi kabatamvwisisisyi nikuba eezyo nzibaamba nikuba zintu nzibachita abusichaamba.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Lino tulizi kuti mulawu mubotu, kuti umwi wawubelesya munzila yeelede, <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />katumvwisisisya eechi, kuti mulawu teewakabikkilwa baluleme pe, pesi kuli batyola mulawu abataswiilili, kuli batakombi abasizibi, batasalali abasofwede, bajeya bamawisi abajeya bamanyina, abajayi babantu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />bantu bachita malalane, bawonana baalumi kubaalumi, banakazi kubanakazi, babba bantu kababatola mubuzike, babeji, bakonka chakubeja, alimwi kufumbwa chimbi chikazyaniya anjiisyo iluleme, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />mukweendelana amakani mabotu abulemu aLeza ulongezedwe ngindakasyomegwa.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulu Mbwakasanduka Kuba Mutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ndilamulumba Kkirisitu Jesu Mwami wesu, wakandipa nguzu nkaambo wakandichita usyomekede akundisala kumulimu wakwe, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />nikuba kuti muchiindi chakayinda ndakasampawula akupenzya alimwi ndakalwaniya, pesi ndakatambula luse nkaambo ndakazichita mukutaziba amukutasyoma, <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />alimwi luzyalo lwaMwami wesu lwakafwasuka zyiindilide ankaambo kandime akweeta lusyomo aluyando eezyo zili muli Kkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Kwaamba ooku nkwachoonzyo alimwi kuleelela kuzumizigwa kuzwide, kuti Kkirisitu Jesu wakasika munyika kuti afutule basizibi. Alimwi ndime ndisizibi mupati; <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />pesi ndakatambula luse ankaambo kacheechi, kuti mulindime, mbuli sizibi uyindilide, Jesu Kkirisitu atondeezye kuba amoyo mulamfu ululeme nkaambo kachitondeezyo kuli baabo bayoosyoma muli nguwe kwalyoonse. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />KuMwami walyoonse, utafwi, utaboneki, Leza alikke, kube kulemeka abulemu kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoti, mwanaangu, mulayizyo ooyu nduupeda kulinduwe, mbuli mukweendelana amajwi abusinsimi aayo akalulama kuli nduwe, aayo akambuulwa ambabo kuchitila kuti akwaatobelezya ukonzye kulwana kabotu, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />kujisi lusyomo achiwa chibotu. Akukaka chiwa, bamwi bantu bakanyonyoona lusyomo lwabo. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Bamwi babo kuli Himeniyasi aAlekizanda, aabo mbindakaaba kuli Satani kuchitila kuti bayiye kutasampawula.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Kukomba Mumbungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Lutaanzi, eelyo, ndamukumbila kuti kukumbila, nkombyo, akukumbilila akupa kulumba zichitilwe bantu boonse, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />kubami aboonse bali mubweendelezi, kuti tupone chuumunizi abuumi bwaluumuno, bwabu leza alimwi bwakulemekana munzila yoonse. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Eechi nchibotu, alimwi chilatambulika mubusyu bwaLeza Mufutuli wesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />ooyo uyandisya kuti bantu boonse bafutulwe alimwi kuti babe aluzibo lwakasimpe. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Nkaambo kuli Leza umwi luzutu, alimwi kuli simwiimaakati umwi akati kaLeza abantu, muntu Kkirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />wakalipeda mbuli chinunuzyo chabantu boonse, bukamboni bwakapegwa kuchiindi cheelede. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Nkaambo kacheechi ndakasalwa kuti ndibe mukambawusi amutumwa amuyiisi kubantu batazi Leza mulusyomo akasimpe. Tandiliikubejape, ndiliikwaamba kasimpe.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Eelyo ndayandisya kuti mubusena boonse baalumi beelede bakombe, kabasumpwide maboko asalala kakutakwe lunyemo nikuba kukazyana; <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />alubo kuti banakazi beelede kusama chabulemu alimwi zili kabotu mukulangika mubuntu, peepe kupesa masusu nikuba ingolide nikuba bulungu nikuba zisamo zyamuulo udula <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />pesi amilimu mibotu, mbuli iyeelede banakazi balipedelede kukukomba Leza. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Muleke mwanakazi ayiiye muchuumunizi akulibombya koonse. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Tandizumizyi mwanakazi pe kuyiisya nikuba kuba abweendelezi atala abaalumi; weelede kawumwide. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Matl 2:7</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo Adamu wakalengwa lutaanzi, eelyo Eva; <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Matl 3:1-6</ref>.</char></note>Alimwi Adamu teengwakeenwa pe, pesi mwanakazi ngwakeenwa mpawo wakaba sikubisya. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kakuli mwanakazi uyoofutulwa mukwiinda mukutumbuka bana, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikuba</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mukutumbuka bana</char></note> naa wayinkilila anembo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wayinkilila anembo</char></note> mulusyomo, aluyando, abusalali akulibamba.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Bazulidi Mumbungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Kwaamba ooku nkwachoonzyo: Kuti umwi wayanda mulimu wabuzulidi, wayanda mulimu mubotu. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Lino muzulidi weelede kuba utakwe kampenda, mulumi wamwanakazi uumwi, ulaamoyo mubombe, ulizyotolola, uli achiwa chibotu, uyobolola beenzu, ukonzya kuyiisya, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />peepe ukolwa, peepe sinkondo pesi mubombe, peepe ukazyana, alimwi peepe simuyanda imali. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Weelede kweendelezya ŋanda yakwe kabotu, uyiisya bana bakwe chakulibombya akulemeka munzila yoonse; <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />nkaambo kuti muntu katakonzyi kubamba kabotu ŋanda yakwe, ngoliibamba biyeni mbungano yaLeza? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Tayelede kuba mukombi mupya pe, ambweni ngoolalisumpula mpawo awide muchisubulo mbuli Sikuchenga; <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />weelede alubo kuba ampuwo mbotu kuli bali kunze, ambweni nga ulawida mukuweelwa amukakole kaSikuchenga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikuba</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mukuweelwa</char></note><verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basikuwutawuka Mumbungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Basikuwutawuka kulikozyene beelede kuba balemekeka, basyomeka, alimwi peepe bakolwi, peepe batangazu kukujana; <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />beelede kujatisya nsiinswa yalusyomo amoyo ululeme. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Alimwi lutaanzi mweelede mubasunke lubo; eelyo naa bajanika kabatakwe kampenda lino ngababeleke mbuli basikuwutawuka. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Alabo banakazi babo kulikozyene beelede kuba balemekeka, peepe basampawula, pesi balibatamika, basyomeka muzintu zyoonse. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Basikuwutawuka beelede kuba amwanakazi uumwi, alimwi bakonzye kweendelezya kabotu bana babo antoomwe aŋanda yabo; <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />nkaambo aabo babeleka kabotu mbuli basikuwutawuka, balalijanina impuwo mbotu alimwi alubo abusichaamba bupati mulusyomo luli muli Kkirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Insiinswa Mpati yaLusyomo Lwesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ndilangilila kuza kuli ndinywe chakufwambana, pesi ndiliikumulembela malayilile aaya kuli ndinywe kuchitila kuti, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />naa ndachedwa kuza, muyooziba mbumweelede kulibamba muŋanda yaLeza, eeyo ilimbungano yaLeza upona, musemo alimwi intalisyo yakasimpe. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Kakutakwe kudoneeka, tulalyaambilila, niinsinswa yabukombi bwesu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Wakaliboniya mumubili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">wakalitondeezya muMuuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">wakabonwa abaangelo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">wakakambawukwa akati kamanyika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">wakasyomwa munyika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">wakatolwa mubulemu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Bayiisyi Babeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Lino Muuya waamba antanganana kuti muchiindi chakumamanino bamwi bayoozwa kulusyomo akutobela myuuya yalweeno anjiisyo zyabasikazwa, <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />mukwiinda munjiisyo zyakuupawupa zyababeji bali amyoyo mbuli bakawumpwa alubulo lupya, <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />bakasya bantu kukwataana akulesya zyakulya eezyo Leza nzyakalenga kuti kazitambulwa akulumba abaabo basyoma akuziba kasimpe. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Nkaambo choonse chintu chakalengwa aLeza chilikabotu, alimwi taakwe chiyeelede kukakwa kuti kachili chatambulwa akulumba, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />nkaambo eelyo chinooli chasalazigwa ajwi lyaLeza ankombyo.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulanda Mubotu WaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Naa wabikka malayilile aaya kunembo lyabakwesu, uyooba simulimu mubotu waKkirisitu Jesu, wakakomezegwa amajwi alusyomo anjiisyo imbotu njimwakatobela. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Utabi azyakuchita ansyomo zitali zyabunaLeza alimwi ansyomo zyabufubafuba. Uliyiisye mubunaLeza. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Nkaambo kuyiisya mubili kulagwasya buniini biyo, buleza mbupati munzila yoonse, mbuli mbuchinyampwide chisyomezyo chabuumi bwalino alimwi alubo bwabuumi buchiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Kwaamba ooku nkwachoonzyo alimwi kuleelelwa kutambulika zizwide. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Nkaambo kacheechi tuliikuzuzaana akudunamina, nkaambo tuli abulangilizi bwesu bubikkidwe ali Leza muumi, Mufutuli wabantu boonse, kapati kuli baabo basyoma.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Kulayilila akuyiisya zintu eezi. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Kutabi umwi uubawusya bukubusi bwako, pesi ube chitondezyo kubasyomi mukwaambula amukuloma, muluyando, mulusyomo, mukusalala. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Mane ndikaboole, sungwaala kukubalwa kwalugwalo antanganana, kukusungwaazya basyomi akukuyiisya. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Utalekeleli chipo nchulaacho, nchwakapegwa mukwiinda mukwaambuula kwabusinsimi aawo inkuta yabaalu niyakabikka maanza aabo alinduwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Chita milimu eeyi, ulipede kulinjiyo, kuchitila kuti boonse babone kuzwidilila kwako. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ulilingule anjiisyo yako; jatisisya kuzintu eezi, nkaambo akuchita oobo uyoolifutula abakuswiilizya.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Milimu Yakuzulida Basyomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Utakalalili munene pesi mwaambile mbuli mbuchita kuli wuso; ujate baalumi bakubusi mbuli bakulana bako, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />banakazi bakakomena mbuli bamanyokwe, banakazi bakubusi mbuli bachizi, mubusalali boonse.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Mulemeke bamukabafu aabo bali bamukabafu choonzyo. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Kuti mukamufu kali abana nikuba bazukulu, mubaleke lutaanzi bayiiye mulimu wabo wabukombi kumpuli yabo alimwi balumbule bazyali babo mbuli mbubakabalela; nkaambo eechi chilatambulika kubusyu bwaLeza. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Ooyo mukamufu wachoonzyo, alimwi ucheede aliikke, kabikkide bulangilizi bwakwe kuliLeza akwiinkilila anembo mukukumbila ankombyo mansiku asikati; <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />pesi mukamufu ooyo uyandisya zyakulibotezya ulifwide nikuba kachipona. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Balayilile mabambe aaya, kuchitila kuti kutabi upa mulandu. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Kuti uumwi katasanini bakunzubo zyakwe, alimwi kapati bakumpuli yakwe, wakaka lusyomo alimwi wabija kwiinda utasyomi.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Kutabi mukamufu ulembwa mumweelwe wabamukabafu, kunze akuti kalaaminyaka iyinda makumi musanu akkumi limwi, kanooli wakali mwanakazi wakali kwetwe lumwi, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />alimwi weelede abe ampuwo mbotu kumilimu yakwe, kali uumwi wakakomezya kabotu bana bakwe, usamawusya beenzu, usanzya mawulu abasalali, ugwasya bali mumapenzi, alimwi ulipeda kukuchita chibotu munzila yoonse.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Pesi mukake kulemba bamukabafu bakubusi; nkaambo kuti ziyandisyo zyabo zyamubili zyabachita kuti bayande kukwatwa, balamusiya Kkirisitu akuyanda kukwatwa, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />alimwi aboobo balalyeetela mulandu wakutyola chizuminano chabo chitaanzi. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Kwataba oobo, balayiiya kuba batolo, beendenda kuŋanda akuŋanda, alimwi peepe batolo luzutu pesi balavwiya akunyonganya, kabaamba eezyo nzibatayelede kwaamba. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Aboobo ndilati bamukabafu bachili bakubusi bakwatwe, bazyale bana, beendelezye ŋanda zyabo, alimwi batapi mweenya kuli sinkondoma kuti ataambuuli bubi atala andiswe. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Nkaambo bamwi bakatobela Satani kale. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Kuti kakuli mwanakazi usyoma kali anzubo zyakwe zilaabamukabafu, ngabagwasizye; imbungano tiiyelede kulemenwa pe, kuchitila kuti ikonzye kugwasizya aabo bamukabafu bachoonzyo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Baalu bambungano beendelezya kabotu beelede kulemekwa zyiindilide, kapati aabo bajisi mulimu wakukambawuka akuyiisya; <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Det 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:9">1 Kkor 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kkor 9:14</ref>.</char></note> nkaambo imalembe aamba kuti, “Utamwaangi mulomo musune kuti kawulyatawula zilyo,” alimwi, “Simulimu weelede kujana muholo wakwe.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Det 19:15</ref>.</char></note> Utazumini kufumbwa mulandu utamikizigwa mwaalu wambungano kunze abukamboni bwabantu babili nikuba batatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Mbuli kuli baabo bakakatila muchibi, bakalalile kunembo lyabantu boonse, kuchitila kuti bamwi boonse bayoowe.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Kunembo lyaLeza alya Kkirisitu Jesu abaangelo basale ndamulayilila kuti muchite malayilile aaya kakutakwe kusalula, mutachiti chintu kufumbwa akusalula. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Mutafwambani kubikka maboko, nikuba kulidilana muzibi zyabamwi; mulibambe kamusalala. <verse eid="1TI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Utanywi meenda luzutu, pesi ubelesye wayini muche nkaambo kabula bwako akuchiswa kwako lyoonse.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Zibi zyabamwi bantu zilaboneka antanganana, zibazulida kulubeta, pesi zibi zyabamwi ziboneka muchiindi. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Aboobo alubo milimu mibotu ilaliboniya; alimwi nikuba kuti ngateembubo, tayikkalilili pe kayisisikene.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Bantu boonse bali mujogwe lyabuzike bayeeye basimalelo babo mbuli mukweelela kwabulemu boonse, kuchitila kuti izina lyaLeza anjiisyo zitasampawulwi. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Aabo bali abasimalelo babo basyoma tabeelede kutondeezya kutabalemeka pe nkaambo kakuti mbabunyina; pesi beelede kubakutawukila zilikabotu mbukunga aabo bajana amulimu wabo mbasyomi abayandwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Injiisyo Yakubeja Abuvubi Bwachoonzyo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Amuyiisye akusungwazya milimu eeyi. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Kuti umwi muntu kayiisya nikuba boobo alimwi katazuminani amajwi akasimpe aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu anjiisyo eeyo yeendelana a bunaLeza, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />uzwide kulisumpula, taakwe nchazi pe; uli abulwazi bwakuyanda kukazya akukangana atala amajwi, aayo azyala bbivwe, kutamvwanana, kutukila, abuumi bwakuyeeyelana bubi, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />alimwi weeta lupyopyongano akati kabantu bali amizeezo isofweede alimwi batakonzyi kuziba kasimpe, kabayeeya kuti bunaLeza niinzila yakujana.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Kuli kujana kupati mubuleza akukkusikana. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />nkaambo taakwe nchitwakeeta pe munyika, alimwi taakwe nchitubweza kuzwa munyika, <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />pesi kuti katuli achakulya azisamo, azeezi tuyookkutikana. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Pesi aabo bayandisya kuba bavubi balawida mumasunko, mukakole, muzyiingi zyabufubafuba aziyandisyo zichisya eezyo zikwela bantu mukunyonyooka akuloba. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Nkaambo kuyandisya mali ngiimatalikilo abubi boonse, mukwiinda mukuyandisya eechi kwakapa kuti bamwi basweeke kuzwa kulusyomo mpawo bakayasa myoyo yabo amachise mayingi.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malayilile Alangene aTimoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Pesi mbuli nduwe, muntu waLeza, siya eechi choonse; udunamine busalali, bunaLeza, lusyomo, luyando, lukakatilo alubombo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Lwana kulwana kubotu kwalusyomo; ujatisye buumi butamani oobo mbwakayitilwa, nwaakalyambilila kabotu kunembo lyabakamboni mayingi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jn 18:37</ref>.</char></note>Kunembo lyaLeza upa buumi kuzintu zyoonse, alya Kkirisitu Jesu ooyo mubukamboni bwakwe kunembo lya Pontiyasi Payileti wakachita kulyambilila kubotu, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />ndakulayilila kuti ubambe mulawu kakutakwe kampenda akusampawula mane kuliboniya kwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />alimwi eecho chiyooyubununwa kuchiindi cheelede awulongezedwe alimwi Mweendelezi aliikke, alimwi Mweendelezi wabeendelezi, Mwami wabami, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />ooyo aliikke nguutalobi mpawo ukkala mumumuni utasikiki, ooyo kutakwe muntu wakalina mubona nikuba ukonzya kumubona. Kulinguwe ngakube bulemu abweendelezi kwalyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Layilila aabo bavubi munyika eeno, kuti tabeelede kulisumpula pe, nikuba kubikka bulangilizi kubuvubi bwabo butali kabotu pesi ali Leza utupa zyoonse kuti tubotelwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Beelede kuchita chibotu, kuti babe bavubi mukuchita milimu bubotu, alimwi bape chabuuya akwaangunuka. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Akuchita oobo bayoolibambila buvubi mbuli ntalisyo kuchiindi chiboola, kuchitila kuti bakajane buumi oobo bwachoonzyo.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoti, kwabilila eecho nchuwakapegwa aLeza. Siya bwambuuzi butali bwabunaLeza akukazyaniya kwazyakubeja kazitegwa nduzibo, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />ankaambo kakutobelezya nchicho bamwi bakaleya kuzwa kulusyomo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Luzyalo lube andinywe moonse.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>